Too bad. Here's what I would do if I could.  I'd pick up the box
with 2 zeros in it and set it down. Then I'd take the box with 1
zero and drop it on the edge of the other box. I'd pick up the combined
box and put it in the second hole of the empty box. Then I'd pick
up the whole thing.

